## A matte sphere 0.3 above a large upward panel emitter, the near field of the teapot
## museum shot's lightbox, where a draw's weight varies most across the emitter. Not third-party.
Display "arealight_nearfield.tif" "file" "rgba"
Format 64 48 1
PixelSamples 1 1
Option "raytracer" "integer arealightsamples" [16]
Projection "perspective" "fov" [40]
Clipping 0.5 50
Translate 0 0 5
WorldBegin
AttributeBegin
Surface "matte" "Kd" [0]
AreaLightSource "arealight" 1 "intensity" [0.6]
Polygon "P" [-4.2 -1.3 -3.2  -4.2 -1.3 3.2  4.2 -1.3 3.2  4.2 -1.3 -3.2]
AttributeEnd
Surface "matte" "Kd" [0.8]
Sphere 1 -1 1 360
WorldEnd
